# Built bundled-resource payloads are platform-specific (mac/win/linux binaries).
# They must NOT leak from the host into the Docker context — the image builds
# its own Linux payloads via `npm run predist`, and the build scripts skip-if-built,
# so a stale mac payload would ship mac binaries in a linux image. Only the
# bundled Node remains as a resource.
resources/node
# Leftover build archives (resources/node/*.tar.gz) are created then deleted
# by the build scripts; exclude any that linger from an interrupted host build.
resources/**/*.tar.gz
resources/**/*.tgz
resources/**/*.tar.xz
facet/web/dist

# 会话存档的 SDK 二进制与 RSA 私钥**绝不进镜像**。
#
# Dockerfile 用的是 `COPY . .`（不是白名单），所以"没人会把 SDK 放进仓库"这句话
# 不能当作保障：官方 SDK 由客户自己下载，私钥由客户自己挂载，只要有人顺手把它们
# 放在仓库目录里，一次构建就会把两样东西一起打进镜像层。
# 这两类东西一旦进了镜像层，删文件也没用——层还在。
#
# 对应任务：add-archive-sidecar-delivery 1.1 / add-wecom-archive-ingest 7.1。
# 判据是构建产物里 find 不到 libWeWorkFinanceSdk*，而不是"我们没主动 COPY"。
**/libWeWorkFinanceSdk*
*.pem
**/*.pem
*.key
**/*.key
# 私钥常见的其他落点
**/private_key*
**/apiclient_key*

